+/*
+ * bwfm(4) SDIO attachment for FreeBSD's MMCCAM sdiob(4).
+ *
+ * sdiob(4) creates one child device per SDIO function; bwfm attaches to
+ * function 1 and drives function 2 (the frame FIFO) through the same
+ * sdiob bus methods.  Register access follows OpenBSD's driver: CMD52 for
+ * byte registers, a single 4-byte CMD53 for 32-bit backplane registers,
+ * incrementing CMD53 for RAM and for writes, fixed-address CMD53 for F2
+ * reads.  sdiob(4) has no card interrupt support, so the CCCR interrupt
+ * pending register is polled from the driver's own thread.
+ */
 
